# AGENTS.md

## Architecture: Hexagonal (Ports & Adapters)

- `src/domain/` — entities and business rules, no framework imports
- `src/application/` — use cases, orchestrates domain logic via ports
- `src/ports/` — interfaces the application layer depends on (repositories, gateways)
- `src/adapters/` — concrete implementations of ports (Postgres repository, HTTP controllers, message consumers)

New business logic goes in `src/application/`. New persistence or transport
code goes in `src/adapters/`, implementing an existing port under `src/ports/`
rather than reaching into the domain layer directly.

## Conventions

- Constructor injection only; no property injection.
- Domain entities never import anything from `@nestjs/*`.
